{
  "id": 490170154,
  "iid": 25151,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "NAS-5GS: Add missing URSP type registrations and parsers",
  "description": "## Summary\n\nRegister previously unknown URSP type identifiers and add parsers for PIN ID and Connectivity group ID traffic descriptors.\n\n## Problem\n\nThree type identifiers are missing from the value_string tables, causing them to display as \"Unknown\":\n\n- RSD 0x84: Displayed as `Unknown (132)` — type name not registered\n- TD 0xA2: Displayed as `Unknown (162)` + `IE not dissected yet` — type name not registered and no parser\n- TD 0xA3: Displayed as `Unknown (163)` + `IE not dissected yet` — type name not registered and no parser\n\n## Changes\n\nRoute selection descriptor (`nas_5gs_ursp_r_sel_desc_comp_type_values`):\n- Added `{ 0x84, \"5G ProSe multi-path preference type\" }` (zero-length value, no parser needed)\n\nTraffic descriptor (`nas_5gs_ursp_traff_desc_component_type_values`):\n- Added `{ 0xa2, \"PIN ID type\" }`\n- Added `{ 0xa3, \"Connectivity group ID type\" }`\n\nTraffic descriptor parser (`de_nas_5gs_ursp_traff_desc`):\n- Added `case 0xa2`: 1-byte length + UTF-8 string\n- Added `case 0xa3`: 1-byte length + UTF-8 string\n\nAlso added 4 new `hf` field declarations and registrations.\n\n## Specification Reference\n\n3GPP TS 24.526 Section 5.2:\n\n> For \"PIN ID type\", the traffic descriptor component value field shall be encoded as a sequence of a one octet length field and a PIN ID value field.\n\n> For \"connectivity group ID type\", the traffic descriptor component value field shall be encoded as a sequence of a one octet length field and a connectivity group ID value field.\n\n> For \"5G ProSe multi-path preference type\", the route selection descriptor component shall not include the route selection descriptor component value field.\n\n## Testing\n\nVerified with pcap files:\n\n- **5G ProSe multi-path (RSD 0x84)**\n  - Before: `Unknown (132)`\n  - After: `5G ProSe multi-path preference type (132)`\n\n- **PIN ID (TD 0xA2)**\n  - Before: `Unknown (162)` + `IE not dissected yet`\n  - After: `PIN ID type (162)` / `PIN ID length: 7` / `PIN ID: pin-001`\n\n- **Connectivity group ID (TD 0xA3)**\n  - Before: `Unknown (163)` + `IE not dissected yet`\n  - After: `Connectivity group ID type (163)` / `Connectivity group ID length: 8` / `Connectivity group ID: group-01`\n\nReproduction pcaps:\n- [RSD_0x84_ProSe_multipath.pcap](https://gitlab.com/-/project/82634231/uploads/496d8e67375d763f0979591b773eb4b1/RSD_0x84_ProSe_multipath.pcap)\n- [TD_0xA2_PIN_ID.pcap](https://gitlab.com/-/project/82634231/uploads/72108d6288076477bb16e41cb78a8698/TD_0xA2_PIN_ID.pcap)\n- [TD_0xA3_connectivity_group_ID.pcap](https://gitlab.com/-/project/82634231/uploads/4df9748b4fd208b61a8d615c391fb4a5/TD_0xA3_connectivity_group_ID.pcap)",
